WEBVTT

00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:14,820
Can I get a genetic test for family members, is there a discount?

00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:23,700
So for our full members, yes, we've typically, at different times, offered discounts for

00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:30,500
family members to get a genetic test. So just call the office and we could discuss the options

00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:37,540
with that to move forward with a genetic test for family members. It's not uncommon that we do

00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:42,820
a full genetic workout, but somebody we have our genetic review and this information is so

00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:49,220
eye-opening sometimes that it's like, oh my gosh, I'd really like to get a genetic review

00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:53,860
for my husband or for my child or something like that and that can be very beneficial for

00:00:54,420 --> 00:01:03,940
moving forward with their health issues.

